\ ARM7TDMI设备定义 - Forth文件
\ 生成自: ARM/ARM7/ARM7TDMI
\ 版本: 1.0
\ 日期: 2026-04-16
\ 作者: VML Team
\ 描述: Game Boy Advance main processor - ARM7TDMI @ 16.78MHz with 32-bit ARM + 16-bit Thumb instruction sets
\ CPU架构: ARM7TDMI
\ 位宽: 32位
\ 时钟频率: 16780000 Hz

\ =========================================
\ ARM7TDMI设备定义
\ =========================================

\ 设备信息
: DEVICE-NAME   S" ARM7TDMI" ;
: MANUFACTURER  S" ARM" ;
: FAMILY        S" ARM7" ;
: VERSION       S" 1.0" ;
: ARCHITECTURE  S" ARM7TDMI" ;
32 CONSTANT BITS
16780000 CONSTANT CLOCK-FREQ

\ 寄存器地址定义
0x00 CONSTANT R0  \ General Purpose Register 0
0x04 CONSTANT R1  \ General Purpose Register 1
0x08 CONSTANT R2  \ General Purpose Register 2
0x0C CONSTANT R3  \ General Purpose Register 3
0x10 CONSTANT R4  \ General Purpose Register 4
0x14 CONSTANT R5  \ General Purpose Register 5
0x18 CONSTANT R6  \ General Purpose Register 6
0x1C CONSTANT R7  \ General Purpose Register 7
0x20 CONSTANT R8  \ General Purpose Register 8
0x24 CONSTANT R9  \ General Purpose Register 9 / SB
0x28 CONSTANT R10  \ General Purpose Register 10 / SL
0x2C CONSTANT R11  \ Frame Pointer / FP
0x30 CONSTANT R12  \ Intra-Procedure-call Scratch Register / IP
0x34 CONSTANT R13  \ Stack Pointer / SP
0x38 CONSTANT R14  \ Link Register / LR
0x3C CONSTANT R15  \ Program Counter / PC
0x40 CONSTANT CPSR  \ Current Program Status Register
0 CONSTANT CPSR-MODE  \ Processor Mode (10000=User, 10001=FIQ, 10010=IRQ, 10011=SVC, 10111=ABT, 11011=UND, 11111=SYS)
5 CONSTANT CPSR-T  \ Thumb State Bit (1=Thumb mode)
6 CONSTANT CPSR-F  \ FIQ Disable
7 CONSTANT CPSR-I  \ IRQ Disable
8 CONSTANT CPSR-A  \ Imprecise Data Abort Disable
9 CONSTANT CPSR-E  \ Endianness (0=Little)
0 CONSTANT CPSR-GE  \ Greater-than-or-Equal flags
31 CONSTANT CPSR-N  \ Negative
30 CONSTANT CPSR-Z  \ Zero
29 CONSTANT CPSR-C  \ Carry
28 CONSTANT CPSR-V  \ Overflow
0x44 CONSTANT SPSR_SVC  \ Saved PSR (Supervisor Mode)
0x48 CONSTANT SPSR_ABT  \ Saved PSR (Abort Mode)
0x4C CONSTANT SPSR_IRQ  \ Saved PSR (IRQ Mode)
0x50 CONSTANT SPSR_FIQ  \ Saved PSR (FIQ Mode)

\ 内存段定义
0x03000000 CONSTANT IWRAM-START
0x03007FFF CONSTANT IWRAM-END
32768 CONSTANT IWRAM-SIZE  \ Internal Work RAM (32KB, 2-cycle access)
0x03008000 CONSTANT IWRAM_FAST-START
0x03FFFFFF CONSTANT IWRAM_FAST-END
32752 CONSTANT IWRAM_FAST-SIZE  \ Internal Work RAM Fast (high-speed region)
0x06000000 CONSTANT VRAM-START
0x06017FFF CONSTANT VRAM-END
98304 CONSTANT VRAM-SIZE  \ Video RAM (96KB + 64KB OBJ VRAM)
0x05000200 CONSTANT PALETTE-START
0x050003FF CONSTANT PALETTE-END
512 CONSTANT PALETTE-SIZE  \ BG Palette RAM (256 colors x 2 bytes)
0x05000400 CONSTANT OBJ_PALETTE-START
0x050005FF CONSTANT OBJ_PALETTE-END
512 CONSTANT OBJ_PALETTE-SIZE  \ Object Palette RAM
0x07000000 CONSTANT OAM-START
0x070003FF CONSTANT OAM-END
1024 CONSTANT OAM-SIZE  \ Object Attribute Memory (OAM, 128 sprites)
0x08000000 CONSTANT ROM-START
0x09FFFFFF CONSTANT ROM-END
33554432 CONSTANT ROM-SIZE  \ Cartridge ROM (max 32MB)
0x0E000000 CONSTANT CART_RAM-START
0x0E00FFFF CONSTANT CART_RAM-END
65536 CONSTANT CART_RAM-SIZE  \ Cartridge SRAM / Flash
0x00000000 CONSTANT BIOS-START
0x00003FFF CONSTANT BIOS-END
16384 CONSTANT BIOS-SIZE  \ GBA BIOS (16KB)
0x04000000 CONSTANT IO_REGS-START
0x04FFFFFF CONSTANT IO_REGS-END
16777216 CONSTANT IO_REGS-SIZE  \ I/O Registers (MMIO)

